WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.874
Poems as pictures.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.365
Photos, follows and novels.

3
00:00:04.485 --> 00:00:06.136
Stats only you can see.

4
00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:08.001
Here's what's new in InkBoard.

5
00:00:10.156 --> 00:00:12.669
Chapter 1 · Share a poem as an image

6
00:00:13.769 --> 00:00:16.900
Every public poem now has a Share as image button.

7
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.612
Pick a design: Page, Ink or Board.

8
00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.810
Story size fills a phone screen.

9
00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:24.517
Chat size fits a message.

10
00:00:24.637 --> 00:00:26.297
Want just a few lines?

11
00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:28.776
Choose them, and the picture shows only those.

12
00:00:28.896 --> 00:00:31.783
Every picture prints a short link back to the poem.

13
00:00:32.846 --> 00:00:35.048
Chapter 2 · Profile photos

14
00:00:36.148 --> 00:00:39.471
Writers can now use a photo instead of an avatar.

15
00:00:39.591 --> 00:00:42.528
Choose a picture, then drag or zoom to crop it.

16
00:00:42.841 --> 00:00:44.281
It shows on your section of the board,

17
00:00:44.301 --> 00:00:46.200
and on your author page.

18
00:00:47.591 --> 00:00:49.677
Chapter 3 · Follow an author

19
00:00:50.777 --> 00:00:53.225
Readers can follow the writers they like.

20
00:00:53.627 --> 00:00:55.827
When a new poem or a new chapter goes up,

21
00:00:55.847 --> 00:00:57.675
a notification arrives.

22
00:00:57.795 --> 00:00:59.865
More from the same writer joins that

23
00:00:59.885 --> 00:01:01.775
notification, quietly.

24
00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:05.122
Chapter 4 · Novels for writers

25
00:01:06.222 --> 00:01:09.565
Start a novel with a title, a language and a status.

26
00:01:10.072 --> 00:01:11.992
The blurb is like the back of a book:

27
00:01:12.012 --> 00:01:13.404
readers see it first.

28
00:01:13.524 --> 00:01:16.295
Upload a cover, and crop it to the shape of a book.

29
00:01:17.174 --> 00:01:18.634
Write each chapter here.

30
00:01:18.654 --> 00:01:21.309
The Drop cap button gives it a large first letter.

31
00:01:21.824 --> 00:01:23.724
Publish chapters one at a time,

32
00:01:23.744 --> 00:01:25.225
and move them into order.

33
00:01:26.774 --> 00:01:29.349
Chapter 5 · Novels for readers

34
00:01:30.449 --> 00:01:32.814
Novels sit on the board as book cards.

35
00:01:33.099 --> 00:01:34.539
Each one has its own page,

36
00:01:34.559 --> 00:01:36.466
with the blurb and the chapters.

37
00:01:36.586 --> 00:01:39.246
Chapters open with the writer's drop cap.

38
00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:42.770
Ewe, Twi and Ga keep every letter and tone mark.

39
00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:43.720
On a phone,

40
00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:46.199
Text settings change the size and the font.

41
00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:48.010
Come back later,

42
00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:50.258
and InkBoard remembers where you stopped.

43
00:01:50.378 --> 00:01:52.638
Save a whole novel to read offline,

44
00:01:52.658 --> 00:01:54.461
or follow it in a feed reader.

45
00:01:55.928 --> 00:01:58.138
Chapter 6 · Private novels

46
00:01:59.238 --> 00:02:00.678
A novel can be private,

47
00:02:00.698 --> 00:02:02.775
with one password for the whole book.

48
00:02:02.895 --> 00:02:04.515
Readers still see the title,

49
00:02:04.535 --> 00:02:06.260
the cover and the chapter list.

50
00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:09.127
Unlock it once, and every chapter opens.

51
00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:13.298
Chapter 7 · Share a passage

52
00:02:14.398 --> 00:02:15.808
At the end of a chapter,

53
00:02:15.828 --> 00:02:17.741
tick the paragraphs you want to quote.

54
00:02:18.248 --> 00:02:21.365
Trim the start and the end, sentence by sentence.

55
00:02:21.698 --> 00:02:24.368
The count keeps you under 600 characters.

56
00:02:24.488 --> 00:02:27.364
And the passage becomes a picture, ready to share.

57
00:02:28.438 --> 00:02:30.739
Chapter 8 · Stats for writers

58
00:02:31.839 --> 00:02:34.295
Stats shows how many devices follow you,

59
00:02:34.489 --> 00:02:36.724
how often your shared links were opened,

60
00:02:37.139 --> 00:02:39.704
and the words and reading time of each novel.

61
00:02:40.189 --> 00:02:42.029
Every number is explained.

62
00:02:42.049 --> 00:02:43.929
No page views, no tracking:

63
00:02:43.949 --> 00:02:46.091
only what InkBoard already keeps.

64
00:02:46.211 --> 00:02:47.491
That's what's new.

65
00:02:47.511 --> 00:02:50.660
Start writing free at tryinkboard.elabo.me
